      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. so when you say the Arab leadership \"strongly rejected\" the plan, was that because they thought the borders were fundamentally unfair or just because they didn't want a Jewish state there at all? i'm trying to figure out the actual motivations behind their stance vs what the Jewish side was thinking.",
